```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f7fb;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #1f2937;
    }

    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 40px 15px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .header {
      background: #2563eb;
      padding: 30px 25px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .header p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 35px 30px;
    }

    .content h2 {
      margin: 0 0 15px;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .content p {
      margin: 0 0 15px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .welcome-box {
      margin: 25px 0;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      background: #eff6ff;
      border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .welcome-box p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #1e40af;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 20px 25px;
      background: #f9fafb;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 4px 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9ca3af;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="header">
        <h1>Developer Assessment</h1>
        <p>Coding & Assessment Platform</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">

        <h2>Welcome, <%= name %>! 👋</h2>

        <p>
          We're excited to welcome you to the
          <strong>Developer Assessment Coding Platform</strong>.
        </p>

        <p> Your account has been created successfully. Welcome to our platform! We're excited to have you as a part of
          our
          community. </p>
        <div class="welcome-box">
          <p> 🚀 We're glad to have you with us. Let's build, connect, and grow together! </p>
        </div>

        <p> Thank you for joining us. We wish you a great experience on the platform. </p>

      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
            Developer Assessment Coding Platform.
        </p>
        <p>All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</body>

</html>
```